n-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":7,"created_at":"2026-01-17T14:01:35Z","updated_at":"2026-05-06T20:00:07Z","closed_at":"2026-05-06T20:00:07Z","assignee":{"login":"RandomShaper","id":11797174,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk3MTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11797174?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper","html_url":"https://github.com/RandomShaper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n-Reproducible in 4.5.1 and 4.6rc1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.rc1 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 with Max-Q Design (NVIDIA; 31.0.15.5123) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-8750H CPU @ 2.20GHz (12 threads) - 7.86 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nI have a crash (or sometimes a bug) when trying to load a scene with ResourceLoaded.load_threaded_request in a very specific case. \n\nI tried to pinpoint what is causing this and have a minimal (or almost) reproduction.\nIt happens when I load a scene A that have two external resources: \n- A Tileset T, used in a TilemapLayer node directly in the scene A\n- A scene B (through a PackedScene export), inheriting another scene C that use the same Tileset T (the tileset has to be referenced in the scene C, it seems to be important).\n \nWhen I do that, I always have one of these results:\n- The engine crashes. It crash there, maybe there's a concurrent access on this vector? \n<img width=\"1060\" height=\"134\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a9c6fb1e-c8f9-4b55-abde-5584c6750771\" />\n\n- The scene load but the TilemapLayers using the Tileset T are not displayed. I tried to break at the beginning of ResourceLoaded.load_threaded_get (after the loading is done), and while my requested load task is finished, I see there's still a thread loading the Tileset T.\n<img width=\"848\" height=\"772\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/61f80c6f-895c-41c0-b21f-ce55be4b4211\" />\n\n- Very rarely, the scene load and everything works correctly. I noticed that if I wait 1s between the request status being THREAD_LOAD_LOADED and calling load_threaded_get, it always works.\n\n\nNote that if in the scene A I reference the scene C instead of B, the Tileset T is still referenced but I don't have any issue anymore. Likewise, if I don't enable sub-threads when requesting the load it works perfectly (but way slower).\n\nSo it's most likely due to how inherited scenes are loaded when using sub-threads. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Launch the included Minimal Reproduction Project (F5)\n    - If you don't see any tilemap, the scene has loaded but the Tileset has not\n    - If you crashed... it crashed :D\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[Crash Resource Loader Sub Threads.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24689558/Crash.Resource.Loader.Sub.Threads.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115069/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/is